WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.801
-Welcome, welcome, welcome. Enjoy yourself.

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:04.167
Welcome to "The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.734
You're all here. Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:08.801
You made it. You look good. Guys, there's some good news.

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:10.767
Today, the World Health Organization

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:13.934
said that the end of the pandemic is in sight.

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:17.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:21.100
Yeah, it was quite a scene at the World Health Organization.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.834
After the announcement, all the scientists

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:24.467
just started making out with each other.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:26.701
It was unbelievable, yeah.

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:29.300
Yep, today Johnson &amp; Johnson was like, "We did it!"

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.501
And Pfizer and Moderna were like, "Yeah. We."

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:33.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:36.734
Yeah, the end of the pandemic is "in sight,"

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:38.734
although I think I'm gonna need more details.

00:00:38.734 --> 00:00:42.033
I mean, technically, the Moon is also in sight.

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.567
Well, some political news here.

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:44.901
I saw that former president Trump

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.868
has officially ruled out Mike Pence

00:00:46.868 --> 00:00:50.234
as a running mate in 2024,

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:52.901
saying that Pence would be totally "inappropriate"

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:56.334
after he committed "political suicide."

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:57.868
By the way, I don't think Pence

00:00:57.868 --> 00:00:59.534
wants to run with Trump either, you know?

00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:01.767
That's like Simon &amp; Garfunkel reuniting

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:03.567
after Simon tried to kill Garfunkel.

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:04.968
You know what I'm saying?

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:08.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.467
Hey, people are talking about this.

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:11.801
Apparently Trump ally Mike Lindell,

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:13.667
also known as the MyPillow guy,

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:16.601
just had his phone confiscated by the FBI.

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:18.501
Here he is telling the story. This is real.

00:01:18.501 --> 00:01:22.200
-The FBI came after me and took my phone.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.100
They surrounded me at a Hardee's,

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.267
and they told me not to tell anybody.

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:28.100
Here's an order not to -- "Don't tell anybody."

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.767
Okay, I won't. [ Chuckles ] Well, I am.

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:32.501
I've been saying it for a long time now.

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:34.067
Come and arrest me.

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:36.734
I want you to take me in! I want you to take me in!

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:40.234
They weren't -- They were actually nice guys.

00:01:40.234 --> 00:01:43.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:45.234
-What?

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:48.234
-I can't believe someone paid $800 for that on Cameo.

00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:50.234
Interesting.

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:52.934
That's right. The FBI surrounded him at a Hardee's.

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:55.567
Yep, he knew something was up when the intercom was like,

00:01:55.567 --> 00:01:57.067
"So that's one burger, one drink,

00:01:57.067 --> 00:02:00.601
and step out of the car please, sir."

00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:03.167
Good luck to Mike Lindell. I'm not sure you want to go

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:04.934
to jail being known as the MyPillow guy.

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:06.133
Anyway. I don't know.

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:08.734
[ Audience oohs ] -Pillow!

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:11.901
-While he was going through a drive-through at Hardee's.

00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:13.434
I mean, I'm a fan. I like Hardee's.

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:15.834
Tariq, do you like Hardee's? -I prefer Arby's.

00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:17.701
-Cinnabon? -Nah, son.

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:19.934
-Krispy Kreme? -Dairy Queen.

00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:22.067
-Best fries? -Five Guys.

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:24.300
-KFC? -Too greasy.

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.367
-Pizza Hut. -You nuts?!

00:02:26.367 --> 00:02:28.567
-Mall Sbarro? -Aw, hell no.

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:30.701
-Benihana? -Always wanna.

00:02:30.701 --> 00:02:32.901
-Jimmy John's? -Nom-nom-noms.

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:34.868
-Olive Garden? -I beg your pardon?!

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:36.901
-Chuck E. Cheese? -[Bleep] please!

00:02:36.901 --> 00:02:39.100
-What about McDonald's? -Always lit.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.501
-♪ Ba-da-ba-ba-ba ♪ -I'm lovin' it.

00:02:41.501 --> 00:02:43.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:49.167 --> 00:02:53.300
-Moving -- Moving on --

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.067
Meanwhile today, guys, President Biden

00:02:55.067 --> 00:02:56.734
visited the Detroit Auto Show.

00:02:56.734 --> 00:02:58.801
And when he was delivering remarks,

00:02:58.801 --> 00:03:00.901
he made sure to keep the audience on their toes.

00:03:00.901 --> 00:03:02.834
Watch and listen to this.

00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:11.701
-Wow. Okay. Alright. Yeah. You can tell he's at an auto show.

00:03:11.701 --> 00:03:14.601
Biden went from zero to 60 in five seconds. You're like...

00:03:14.601 --> 00:03:17.334
[Whispering] Guess what. Guess what. We...

00:03:17.334 --> 00:03:18.634
[Shouting] $350 billion!

00:03:18.634 --> 00:03:21.234
[Normal voice] Okay, okay.

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:22.667
Some business news.

00:03:22.667 --> 00:03:26.067
Yesterday the stock market fell nearly 1,300 points,

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:28.467
had its worst day since 2020.

00:03:28.467 --> 00:03:30.133
Yeah, yesterday at the Stock Exchange,

00:03:30.133 --> 00:03:32.167
instead of the closing bell, they just played this.

00:03:32.167 --> 00:03:35.968
[ "Price is Right" loser horn plays ]

00:03:35.968 --> 00:03:38.534
Yeah, I read that the CEO of Disney said that they are

00:03:38.534 --> 00:03:41.634
working very hard on a sports betting app.

00:03:41.634 --> 00:03:43.934
Yeah, and this is nice -- since it's Disney, they'll snap

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:48.567
a photo of you the moment you lost everything.

00:03:48.567 --> 00:03:52.434
Yeah, Disney wants to own its sporting betting app.

00:03:52.434 --> 00:03:54.267
Yeah, it seems like an odd pairing,

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:56.234
but I guess it explains this I just saw.

00:03:56.234 --> 00:03:58.934
-Gawrsh, Mickey! Why so glum, chum?

00:03:58.934 --> 00:04:01.200
-I bet 50 G's on the Cowboys!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.667
And when I couldn't pay, they took my thumb.

00:04:03.667 --> 00:04:07.634
-Well, maybe next time, bet with your head and not over it!

00:04:07.634 --> 00:04:10.000
-Yeah, thanks for the heads-up, you dumb mother...

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.667 --> 00:04:13.968
-Just odd. Odd thing I just saw.

00:04:13.968 --> 00:04:15.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:15.234 --> 00:04:18.734
I thought it was... -Wow. Inappropriate.

00:04:18.734 --> 00:04:20.801
-Some -- Some more business news.

00:04:20.801 --> 00:04:24.934
Ferrari just unveiled its first-ever four-door car.

00:04:24.934 --> 00:04:27.234
Yeah, right now people who own Ferraris are like,

00:04:27.234 --> 00:04:29.234
"Oh, if only I had three friends."

00:04:29.234 --> 00:04:31.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.234 --> 00:04:34.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:34.534 --> 00:04:36.467
Oh. Thank you. -Wow.

00:04:36.467 --> 00:04:38.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:41.934
-Thank you. -That hit home.

00:04:41.934 --> 00:04:44.701
-Well, listen to this. A Japanese tech company

00:04:44.701 --> 00:04:46.801
created a Bluetooth mouthpiece

00:04:46.801 --> 00:04:49.767
that mutes your voice from people around you.

00:04:49.767 --> 00:04:51.968
And I know what you're thinking. "It's probably some clunky,

00:04:51.968 --> 00:04:54.601
weird piece of technology that no one will ever want to use."

00:04:54.601 --> 00:04:56.801
Well, you're right.

00:04:56.801 --> 00:04:58.701
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.701 --> 00:05:01.801
And finally, I saw that New York might start

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:04.100
putting warning labels on sugary drinks,

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:05.501
and there's also a rumor

00:05:05.501 --> 00:05:07.767
that they might put warning labels on people.

00:05:07.767 --> 00:05:09.968
I'll give you some examples. Here's what they're considering.

00:05:09.968 --> 00:05:12.033
First there's...

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.467
"I'm ready."

00:05:18.467 --> 00:05:20.267
Check out this one. It says...

00:05:23.734 --> 00:05:26.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:26.667 --> 00:05:28.634
Then there's...

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:36.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:36.767 --> 00:05:38.801
And finally, there's...

00:05:40.467 --> 00:05:42.300
There you go. We have a great show.

